    A[L-Alanine Present] --> B[Germinant Signal 1]
    C[Glucose/Fructose/Asparagine] --> D[Germinant Signal 2]
    E[Elevated Temperature] --> F[Environmental Trigger]
    G[Physical Damage] --> H[Mechanical Trigger]
    
    B --> I{OR: Any Germinant<br/>Receptor Activated?}
    D --> I
    F --> I
    H --> I
    
    I -->|Yes| J[Initiate Germination]
    I -->|No| K[Remain Dormant]
    
    K --> L[Spore Dormancy Maintained]
    L --> M[Metabolically Inactive]
    M --> N[Resistant to Stress]
    
    J --> O[GerA Receptor Activation]
    J --> P[GerB/GerK Receptor Activation]
    
    O --> Q[GerAA/AB/AC Trimer]
    P --> R[GerB + GerK Cooperativity]
    
    Q --> S{OR: Receptor<br/>Pathway?}
    R --> S
    
    S -->|Either| T[Release DPA-Ca2+]
    T --> U[Dipicolinic Acid Export]
    U --> V[Ca2+ Mobilization]
    V --> W[Core Begins Rehydration]
    
    W --> X[Water Influx]
    X --> Y[Core Swelling]
    Y --> Z[Increased Core Volume]
    
    Z --> AA{AND: DPA Released +<br/>Core Hydrated?}
    U --> AA
    
    AA -->|Yes| AB[Commit to Germination]
    AB --> AC[Irreversible Commitment]
    
    AC --> AD[CwlJ Cortex Hydrolase Activation]
    AD --> AE[SleB Cortex Hydrolase Activation]
    
    AE --> AF{OR: Which Hydrolase<br/>Active?}
    AD --> AF
    
    AF -->|CwlJ| AG[Cortex Peptidoglycan Cleavage]
    AF -->|SleB| AG
    
    AG --> AH[/Cortex Degradation/]
    AH --> AI[Loss of Mechanical Rigidity]
    AI --> AJ[Full Core Expansion]
    
    AJ --> AK[Cortex Fragments Released]
    AK --> AL[Germ Cell Wall Exposed]
    
    AL --> AM[Phase Darkening Visible]
    AM --> AN[Loss of Heat Resistance]
    AN --> AO[Loss of Refractility]
    
    AJ --> AP[Metabolic Reactivation]
    AP --> AQ[ATP Synthesis Resumes]
    AQ --> AR[NADH Production]
    AR --> AS[Respiratory Chain Active]
    
    AS --> AT{AND: Energy +<br/>Core Hydrated?}
    AJ --> AT
    
    AT -->|Yes| AU[DNA Repair Systems Active]
    AU --> AV[/Small Acid-Soluble Proteins Degraded/]
    AV --> AW[DNA Accessibility Restored]
    AW --> AX[RNA Polymerase Access]
    
    AX --> AY[Transcription Initiated]
    AY --> AZ[Early Germination Genes]
    AZ --> BA[Ribosome Assembly]
    BA --> BB[Translation Begins]
    
    BB --> BC[Protein Synthesis]
    BC --> BD[Cell Wall Synthesis Enzymes]
    BD --> BE[Peptidoglycan Biosynthesis]
    BE --> BF[New Cell Wall Formation]
    
    BC --> BG[DNA Replication Enzymes]
    BG --> BH[Chromosome Replication]
    
    BF --> BI[Cell Elongation]
    BI --> BJ[Outgrowth Begins]
    BJ --> BK[Vegetative Cell Emerges]
    
    BK --> BL[Cell Division Machinery]
    BL --> BM[First Division]
    BM --> BN[Two Vegetative Cells]
    
    AP --> BO[Nutrient Uptake Systems]
    BO --> BP[Glucose Transporters Active]
    BP --> BQ[Amino Acid Permeases]
    BQ --> BR[Metabolic Substrates Available]
    BR --> AS
    
    J --> BS{OR: Abort<br/>Germination?}
    BS -->|Nutrients Depleted| BT[Germination Failure]
    BS -->|Proceed| AB
    
    BT --> BU[Superdormant State]
    BU --> BV[Requires Stronger Germinant]
    
    AC --> BW[Point of No Return]
    BW --> BX{Nutrients<br/>Available?}
    BX -->|Yes| AP
    BX -->|No| BY[Germination Without Outgrowth]
    BY --> BZ[Cell Death]
    
    AQ --> CA{ATP Sufficient?}
    CA -->|Yes| AU
    CA -->|No| CB[Slow Germination]
    CB --> AQ
    
    AJ --> CC[pH Equilibration]
    CC --> CD[Core pH Rises]
    CD --> CE[Enzyme Activity Restored]
    CE --> AP
    
    BN --> CF[Return to Growth]
    CF --> CG[Exponential Phase]
    

